# TypeScript

- Use TypeScript only.
- Never create JavaScript files.
- Avoid any unless unavoidable.
- Prefer explicit types for props and public APIs.

# React

- Use functional components.
- Use hooks.
- Prefer const.
- Never use var.
- Avoid unnecessary:
  - useEffect
  - useMemo
  - useCallback

# Components

- One component should have one responsibility.
- Keep components under ~250 lines.
- Extract reusable UI into components/ui.